    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12594" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποθαυμάζω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπο-θωυμάζω</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπο-θωμάζω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>marvel much at</i> a thing, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄφαρ δ᾽ ἀπεθαύμασ᾽ ὄνειρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					6.49
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τὰ λεγόμενα, τὸ λεχθέν,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.11
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				30
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πολλὰ ἄλλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.79
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>wonder much,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				1.68
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				2.17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Am.</u>
				13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1242 iii 53
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>: c. part., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ.ὁρέων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.88
				</span></i>
			; folld. by <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰ,</span>
			<i>wonder</i> that . ., <i><span class="en">
				Aeschin.
				1.94
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				119
			</span></i>.—Rare in Trag., <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				318
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OC</u>
				1586
			</span></i>.</div>
